<title>UK: Wuestenrot Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager GZB Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY  * 07.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE    STEP-UP	ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S 07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 07.NOV.97, THEN STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	     *CALL 30.OCT.97 AT PAR</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
